<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus is calling the weary to rest,</l><l>Calling today! calling today!</l><l>Bring Him thy burden and thou shalt be blest:</l><l>He will not turn thee away.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus is waiting, O come to Him now!</l><l>Waiting today! waiting today!</l><l>Come with thy sins, at His feet lowly bow;</l><l>Come, and no longer delay.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus is pleading, O list to His voice!</l><l>Hear Him today! hear Him today!</l><l>They who believe on His name shall rejoice:</l><l>Quickly arise, come away!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
